      "topic": "Hardware and NOS Maintenance Activities",
      "pedagogical_objective": "Understand the key routine maintenance activities necessary for optimal network reliability and performance.",
      "instruction": {
        "title": {
          "en": "Hardware and Network Maintenance Essentials",
